---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="KetoCore | Guía" authGuard={true}>
<style is:global>
.material-symbols-outlined{font-variation-settings:'FILL' 0,'wght' 400,'GRAD' 0,'opsz' 24}
.glass-card{background:rgba(36,34,34,0.4);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);border:1px solid rgba(255,77,0,0.1)}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.step-card{animation:fadeIn 0.4s ease forwards}
.step-number{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:1.25rem}
</style>
<!-- Header -->
<header class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-xl z-50 border-b border-white/5">
<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 h-14 flex items-center justify-between">
<a href="/app/" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-white transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_back</span>
<span class="text-sm font-medium">Volver</span>
</a>
<h1 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white">Guía de Uso</h1>
<div class="w-20"></div>
</div>
</header>

<main class="pt-20 pb-8 px-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="background:#131315">

<!-- Header editorial -->
<div style="margin:6px 2px 16px">
  <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ff4d00;margin-bottom:10px">Ayuda · Primeros pasos</div>
  <h1 class="kc-h1" style="font-size:30px">Guía de uso</h1>
</div>

<!-- Intro -->
<div class="text-center mb-8">
<div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-container/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary-container" style="font-variation-settings:'FILL' 1">menu_book</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-headline font-bold text-white mb-2">Aprende a usar KetoCore</h2>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant">Sigue estos pasos para sacar el máximo provecho de la app</p>
</div>

<!-- Steps -->
<div class="space-y-4">

<!-- Step 1: Perfil -->
<div class="step-card glass-card rounded-2xl p-5">
<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="step-number bg-primary-container text-white flex-shrink-0">1</div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container">person</span>
<h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white">Completa tu Perfil</h3>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Configura tus datos para calcular tus macros personalizados.</p>
<div class="bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-lg">check</span>Peso actual y meta de peso</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-lg">check</span>Altura, edad y sexo</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-lg">check</span>Nivel de actividad física</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3">
<a href="/app/perfil" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-container text-sm font-medium hover:underline">
<span>Ir al Perfil</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Step 2: Checklist -->
<div class="step-card glass-card rounded-2xl p-5" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="step-number bg-primary-container text-white flex-shrink-0">2</div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container">fact_check</span>
<h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white">Usa el Checklist Diario</h3>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Registra tu agua, electrolitos, ejercicio y más cada día.</p>
<div class="bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-400 text-lg">water_drop</span>Agua: 3L diarios</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-yellow-400 text-lg">science</span>Electrolitos: 500ml</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-lg">fitness_center</span>Ejercicio: 60 minutos</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3">
<a href="/app/checklist" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-container text-sm font-medium hover:underline">
<span>Ir al Checklist</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Step 3: Plan Semanal -->
<div class="step-card glass-card rounded-2xl p-5" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="step-number bg-primary-container text-white flex-shrink-0">3</div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container">event_note</span>
<h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white">Planifica tu Semana</h3>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Genera un plan de comidas automático o crea el tuyo manualmente.</p>
<div class="bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-green-400 text-lg">auto_awesome</span>Generador automático de planes</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-yellow-400 text-lg">block</span>Excluye ingredientes no deseados</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-lg">swap_horiz</span>Substitución automática de recetas</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3">
<a href="/app/plan" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-container text-sm font-medium hover:underline">
<span>Ir al Plan</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Step 4: Alimentos -->
<div class="step-card glass-card rounded-2xl p-5" style="animation-delay:0.3s">
<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="step-number bg-primary-container text-white flex-shrink-0">4</div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container">restaurant</span>
<h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white">Gestiona tu Despensa</h3>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Añade alimentos disponibles y genera tu lista de compras.</p>
<div class="bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-lg">add_circle</span>Añade alimentos con código de barras</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-400 text-lg">shopping_cart</span>Genera lista de compras semanal</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-lg">category</span>Organiza por categorías</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3">
<a href="/app/alimentos" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-container text-sm font-medium hover:underline">
<span>Ir a Alimentos</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Step 5: Macros -->
<div class="step-card glass-card rounded-2xl p-5" style="animation-delay:0.4s">
<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="step-number bg-primary-container text-white flex-shrink-0">5</div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container">donut_small</span>
<h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white">Sigue tus Macros</h3>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Visualiza tu progreso calórico y de nutrientes.</p>
<div class="bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-orange-400 text-lg">local_fire_department</span>Calorías diarias</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-green-400 text-lg">egg_alt</span>Proteína, grasas y carbos</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-lg">monitor_weight</span>Evolución de peso</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3">
<a href="/app/macros" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-container text-sm font-medium hover:underline">
<span>Ir a Macros</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Step 6: Entrenamientos -->
<div class="step-card glass-card rounded-2xl p-5" style="animation-delay:0.5s">
<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="step-number bg-green-500 text-white flex-shrink-0">6</div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-green-400">fitness_center</span>
<h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white">Entrenamientos</h3>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Rutinas personalizadas para casa o gimnasio.</p>
<div class="bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-green-400 text-lg">home</span>Ejercicios sin equipamiento</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-lg">fitness_center</span>Rutinas con pesas</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-lg">bar_chart</span>Historial de progreso</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3">
<a href="/app/entrenamientos" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-container text-sm font-medium hover:underline">
<span>Ir a Entrenamientos</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<!-- Tips Section -->
<div class="mt-8">
<h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">lightbulb</span>
Consejos Rápidos
</h3>
<div class="space-y-3">
<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-yellow-400 flex-shrink-0">touch_app</span>
<div>
<p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Toca el donut chart</p>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant text-[13px] mt-1">En el dashboard puedes tocar el progreso para ver detalles de macros.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0">water_drop</span>
<div>
<p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Registra el agua inmediatamente</p>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant text-[13px] mt-1">Usa el modal rápido de agua desde el dashboard.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container flex-shrink-0">block</span>
<div>
<p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Usa exclusiones inteligentes</p>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant text-[13px] mt-1">En Plan puedes excluir ingredientes y el sistema substituye automáticamente.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary flex-shrink-0">qr_code_scanner</span>
<div>
<p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Escanea códigos de barras</p>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant text-[13px] mt-1">Añade alimentos rápidamente escaneando el producto.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Navigation -->
<div class="mt-8 flex gap-3">
<a href="/app/" class="flex-1 py-4 bg-primary-container text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-center hover:bg-primary-container/80 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">person</span>
Empezar Ahora
</a>
<button onclick="closeGuide()" class="py-4 px-6 bg-surface-container-high text-white/70 rounded-xl font-medium hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-all">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
</button>
</div>

<!-- Remember checkbox -->
<div class="mt-4 text-center">
<label class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant cursor-pointer">
<input type="checkbox" id="dontShowAgain" class="w-4 h-4 rounded border-outline accent-primary-container">
No mostrar de nuevo
</label>
</div>

</main>

<script is:inline>
function closeGuide() {
  if (document.getElementById('dontShowAgain').checked) {
    localStorage.setItem('KetoCore_guide_seen', 'true');
  }
  window.location.href = '/app/';
}

// Check if already seen
if (localStorage.getItem('KetoCore_guide_seen')) {
  window.location.href = '/app/';
}
</script>

</AppLayout>
